        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2241, Hinge Pivot Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2241-specifications.gif?v=1704354619\" width=\"255\" height=\"277\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek 2241 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek Hinge Pivot Stop is for use with solid brass hinges. This Hinge Pin Door Stop is mounted on a door hinge pin instead of on the floor or baseboard. Easily adjustable, simple to use, out of the way and out of sight. We use them on or doors to keep the stops out of reach of the crawling babies! Choose your favorite of the many available finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Hinge Pin Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Diameter: 11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li>Not compatible with steel residential duty hinges.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
